{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tap Monster Saga</i> \u2014 Easy Taps, Strategic Growth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual game that combines tapping, collecting, nurturing, strategy, and idle gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just tap to attack, heal, and level up\u2014zero learning curve, pure fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409540/extras/56175426764a7080402d4100bf035973.poster.avif?t=1773680401\" width=780 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409540/extras/56175426764a7080402d4100bf035973.webm?t=1773680401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409540/extras/56175426764a7080402d4100bf035973.mp4?t=1773680401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock a variety of monsters and build your ultimate team!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique heroes, 90+ skins, 270+ skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero comes with multiple skins, each featuring unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 powerful artifacts to collect and activate mysterious powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ meticulously designed levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-limited challenges + global leaderboards for endless competition</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409540/extras/852c2d4be65c7b44ed3c723dbdbb2941.avif?t=1773680401\" width=1000 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 cla